{
  "$comment": "P4.D152 / v4 bug 117 (0b0617fee). A files-only .qtap whose PNG row carries the PRE-TRANSCODE hash \u2014 exactly what a pre-4.9.0 exporting instance wrote. The importer's bridge transcodes the bitmap, so a row that records the archive's sha256 cannot be joined to the mount blob it points at. The sibling .txt is the no-op arm: its bytes pass the transcode through and its hash was never wrong.",
